        "action" : "stepping down lovelier and calmer than summer",
        "object" : "a thermometer stuck at a mild seventy degrees",
        "notes" : "“Thou art more lovely and more temperate.” One of the sculpted women on the Park Row Building's fourth storey steps down to the pavement, lovelier than any summer's day, holding a thermometer that never moves off a mild seventy degrees."
