        "action" : "carving this sonnet into the salvaged granite steps",
        "object" : "your face rising alive out of the stone",
        "notes" : "“So long lives this, and this gives life to thee.” On the Granite Prospect at Pier 1, steps built from granite salvaged from an old bridge, a stonemason carves this sonnet into the top step, and as he cuts the last word your own face rises out of the stone, alive, looking at the skyline."
